@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@productId = YG001
@userId = cliente123

### Consultar el carrito
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart/{{userId}} HTTP/1.1

### Agregar una caja de jugo de naranja, 4 botellas de 350 ml ($125.00 MXN por caja)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/{{userId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Actualizar la cantidad de un producto del carrito
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cart/{{userId}}/{{productId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Eliminar un producto del carrito
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/{{userId}}/{{productId}} HTTP/1.1
